 ## Subtopics
 
 ### [Spherical Harmonics Approximation](8741-spherical-harmonics-approximation.md)
-A technique to approximate a spherical function using a finite subset of SH basis functions. It sets itself apart from direct ray casting by trading high-frequency accuracy for computational speed and gradient compatibility, making it suitable for optimization tasks where the signal is sufficiently smooth.
